### 6.6 Transverse Residual Double Spin Asymmetry Uncertainty

The longitudinally polarized beams are not always 100% perfectly polarized along the beam moving direction. The asymmetry measured, \(\varepsilon_{LL}\), therefore has contributions not only from the true double longitudinal double spin asymmetry, \(A_{LL}\), but

