Jets triggered by the three jet patch triggers, JP0, JP1 and JP2 from the 2012 RHIC run are counted towards the inclusive jet \(A_{LL}\) calculations. Figure 7.1 shows the total number of jets triggered by the jet triggers used in this analysis. The lowest first two jet \(p_{T}\) bins are solely contributed by the JP0 jets. In the intermediate jet \(p_{T}\) range, JP1 trigger jets dominate. At high jet \(p_{T}\) above 20 GeV, the JP2 jets dominate.

